      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "The Petrick stable have a strong hand in the race. THE ACCELATOR (4) won this last year and returns on the back of a two length win over a mile at Darwin. Back in form and can make it back to back wins. Stablemate AGGRESSIVE (5) was well in the market last time in the same race but safely held beaten eight lengths. Rates highly on the start prior when fourth in the NT Derby. Gets chance to atone. UNQUESTIONABLY (2) is the main danger to both. Bursting to win with a string of placings and looks a genuine chance. ROCK REVOLUTION (1) has been off best last two but rates highly on the run three back. Has speed and will be in this for a long way. Same goes for VILLA SEVENTYNINE (3) who was off best last time but gets chance to atone.",
